      "path": "app/services/bag_search_service.py",
      "content": "Dead code: after this refactor, all call sites switched to the multi-member predicates (`_apply_filters` → `data_kind_pred`, `scene_result_query.search_scene_bags` → `data_kind_pred`) and repo-wide search shows no remaining references to `data_kind_case`. The previous rationale (CASE used for filtering) no longer holds. Keeping it around re-introduces a second source of classification truth that the OCR C5/C6 unification explicitly aimed to eliminate — if the priorities ever diverge between this CASE and `data_kind_pred`/`data_kind_context`, it will silently drift. Suggest removing it unless it is deliberately retained as an exported compatibility API.",
      "existing_code": "def data_kind_case():\n    \"\"\"data_kind SQL CASE（单值展示/兼容口径）：按共享优先级取第一个命中。\"\"\"",
      "start_line": 98,
